3B6DF43CC99286AE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1611132008:0":{"text":"별수 없잖아! 한숨 그만 쉬고, 피파! 긍정적으로 생각해! 운 좋잖아 너! 어쩌면 바로 찾을지도 모르지! ","source_cn":"看来没有别的办法了，别叹气，皮帕，想想好的方面……以你...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE0232D5510168E27","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1611132009:0":{"text":"난 기억의 별보다 그로웬이 더 신경 쓰여. 우리보다 먼저 여기를 지키는 마물을 쓰러뜨렸잖아. 그런데 왜 여긴 아무도 없는 거야?","source_cn":"比起记忆之星，我更在意的是格墨文，他不是赶在我们前面击...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1563F5158525406E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1611132010:0":{"text":"어디선가 숨어서 우리를 기다리고 있는 걸까?","source_cn":"难道他正在哪里埋伏我们？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3FDA738C8B041566","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1611132011:0":{"text":"맞아... 분명 우리가 찾을 때까지 기다렸다가 뒤에서 덮치겠지...! 나... 난 괜찮아! 아... 안 무서워!","source_cn":"我觉得他是不想从这一大群星星里面慢慢翻找……等我们找到...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC590C888FF74A2A4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:15:1611132011":{"text":"맞아... 분명 우리가 찾을 때까지 기다렸다가 뒤에서 덮치겠지...! 나... 난 괜찮아! 아... 안 무서워!","source_cn":"我觉得他是不想从这一大群星星里面慢慢翻找……等我们找到，他会像等候在猎物后面的猛兽一样冲出来吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC590C888FF74A2A4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1611132012:0":{"text":"...사람은 우리가 더 많으니까 일단 기억의 별부터 찾아보자!","source_cn":"……我们人多，就先集中力量找记忆之星吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x160E720D5D5C665E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:15:0:1":{"text":"겁먹을 필요 없어","source_cn":"他不足为惧","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x4C0952C095D2315D","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"겁먹을 필요 없어","female":"겁먹을 필요 없어","variant_male_record_index":"82429","variant_female_record_index":"82430","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:15:1:2":{"text":"내가 있는데 뭐가 걱정이야?","source_cn":"有我在，你们怕什么？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xF05E437C189F6EF3","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"내가 있는데 뭐가 걱정이야?","female":"내가 있는데 뭐가 걱정이야?","variant_male_record_index":"82431","variant_female_record_index":"82432","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:9:0:1":{"text":"얘기하자면 복잡해","source_cn":"说来话长，先别浪费时间了","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xB791C32865CC63B4","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"얘기하자면 복잡해","female":"얘기하자면 복잡해","variant_male_record_index":"82427","variant_female_record_index":"82428","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:7:0:1":{"t